Upstream ggml-org/llama.cpp 8fc037672 (#31247, "cuda: potential fix for Q8_1 correction sum"), MIT.
quantize_q8_1 and quantize_mmq_q8_1 stored the Q8_1 block sum from the float activations instead of d * sum of the
quantized values, so the min / offset term of Q4_0 / Q5_0 (MMVQ), Q4_1 / Q5_1 and Q2_K / Q4_K / Q5_K (MMQ) did not
match the integer dot product. IQ1_S (MMVQ and MMQ) reads the same sum for its +-delta term and changes too.
Other types are unchanged.

